      "message": "some comments - Kai should review so there are other eyes on this.\n\nMentioned to Loko that I\u0027m worried about the code duplication. Maybe eventually we can factor out future/event handling between Emscripten/Dawn, and copy Dawn\u0027s version into Emscripten. Or, perhaps that is not a good idea since ~eventually Emscripten won\u0027t need to live inside Dawn.",
