      "writtenOn": "2024-08-27T16:32:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought the Emscripten implementation could be a bit simpler, so wouldn\u0027t be that badly duplicated, but I don\u0027t remember specifically why I thought that. Anyway we would need to factor out any shared code so we can bring it along when exporting to Emscripten and I think that\u0027s probably not worth the effort.",
