      "writtenOn": "2024-08-23T17:09:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "one alternative here might be to require the app to pass in their own instance.\n\nThat way it would be clear that they are getting a new one each time.\n\nCan\u0027t actually be done now because emscripten_webgpu_get_device doesn\u0027t take args.\n\nbecause you can create the instance with different features enabled, this may be necessary to implement all the validation (like timed wait any max count).",
      "revId": "b1c45a2ec5d2419282333139eed9a419fe95f2bc",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
